Task: InventoryRoutes' publishOutcome removed - outbox write (Phase 1) is now the only side effect (TD-3.3, ADR 0008)

Summary: deleted publishOutcome entirely and its call site in
reserveInventoryServerEndpoint - store.reserve already writes the outbox row
atomically (Phase 1), so there's nothing left to publish from the routes
layer. The StockEventPublisher parameter is kept on the signature (unused in
the body) only because StockEventPublisher itself isn't deleted until Phase 3.

Files changed:
- src/main/scala/inventoryservice/InventoryRoutes.scala - publishOutcome and
  its call removed.
- src/test/scala/inventoryservice/InventoryRoutesSuite.scala - the two tests
  that asserted a publish call on success/InsufficientStock now assert NO
  publish call happens (renamed accordingly); the outbox-row assertions live
  in InventoryStorePostgresSuite instead (Phase 1).

